              ("note", "Key distinction. **DeepSeek-R1** (671B MoE on V3-Base) was trained with GRPO reinforcement learning. The **distilled 7B checkpoint we run was NOT trained with RL**; it only received supervised fine-tuning on R1-generated data [DP section 2.4]. Everything the paper says about GRPO, R1-Zero's 'aha moment' and RL reward design describes R1/R1-Zero, not this checkpoint's own training; it describes where the training data came from."),
